  "name": "Galactic's Conquest launch campaign",
  "category": "product_promotion",
  "description": {
    "text": "The launch campaign for Galactic's Conquest (ギンガの覇道), the first expansion of the Pokémon Card Game DPt series, released in Japan on 10 October 2008. From that day, while stocks lasted, every two packs of Galactic's Conquest bought at once came with one of five original cards, without a choice of which: Team Galactic's SP Pokémon Carnivine G, Probopass G and Darkrai G, and Manaphy and Rotom. Card shops, Pokémon Centers and the 7-Eleven, Lawson, Circle K and Sunkus convenience stores took part. Some shops, though no convenience stores, also gave out an SP Pokémon Secret Fun Book about the expansion's new SP Pokémon.",
